(a) minimum five years of relevant full-time work experience in artificial intelligence, data science and/ or innovation and technology sectors, preferably in managerial role;
(b) previous work experience in investment promotion, account management, business development, marketing; and project management in artificial intelligence, data science, and/ or innovation and technology or public sectors would be an advantage;
(c) a Bachelor’s degree or equivalent, more advanced degree(s) and/or professional qualification(s) would be an advantage;
(d) strong knowledge of and experience in the local and global artificial intelligence, data science, and/ or innovation and technology related sectors;
(e) extensive network in the artificial intelligence, data science, and/ or innovation and technology ecosystem;
(f) strong team spirit, with the ability to work independently in a fast-paced environment and manage multiple tasks simultaneously;
(g) be adaptable, open-minded, and equipped with strong interpersonal skills. Be able to proactively learn new skills, embrace new assignments, and collaborate effectively with diverse stakeholders; 
(h) an international perspective with a good understanding of the Mainland and Hong Kong business environment, Hong Kong’s unique role and contributions to the national policies; and
(i) a strong command of written and spoken English and Chinese (including spoken Putonghua).

[Remark: Candidates may be invited to attend a written test.]

